# `scratch/` — throwaway files

Put probes, debug scripts and one-off experiments here, never in `src/` or
`test/`.

- **Git-ignored**: everything here except this README stays out of commits.
- **Outside the typecheck**: `tsconfig.json` excludes `scratch/`, so a
  half-finished file here cannot fail `npm run typecheck`.
- **Outside the test run**: `vitest.config.ts` collects only `test/**/*.test.ts`
  and excludes `scratch/**`, so a probe here cannot fail `npm test`.

- **Not uploaded**: `civitai app submit` leaves this directory (the one at the
  project root) out of the package, so nothing here reaches the build. A
  `scratch/` deeper in the tree, such as `src/<x>/scratch/`, IS packaged.
